{"id":"n71619-4-15","stage":1,"title":"약하다 · 弱","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71619-4-15-1","ko":"네 동생은 더위에 약한가 봐?","zh":"你弟弟好像很怕热啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"동생은","meaning":"弟弟；妹妹","explanation":"동생：弟弟；妹妹；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"동생","audio":"/audio/bc9b651fd875fefcac75.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70748","senseId":"1","lemma":"동생","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"동생은","audio":"/audio/9196be622beec823bde0.mp3"}},{"text":"더위에","meaning":"热，暑热","explanation":"더위：热，暑热；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"더위","audio":"/audio/34336435fffc87890da8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47399","senseId":"1","lemma":"더위","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더위에","audio":"/audio/dbad57b9c0dd3f1a0e44.mp3"}},{"text":"약한가","meaning":"弱","explanation":"약하다：弱；ㄴ가：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"약하다","audio":"/audio/26dfca7d15ecbdb7d4a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71619","senseId":"4","lemma":"약하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"약한가","audio":"/audio/7f7bd6ebe154f90ef114.mp3"}},{"text":"봐?","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐","audio":"/audio/fdcffec86114c54dd4e0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"bc9b651fd875fefc","term":"동생","zh":"弟弟；妹妹","audio":"/audio/bc9b651fd875fefcac75.mp3","entryId":"70748","definition":"用于指称或称呼相同父母所生的兄弟姐妹或亲戚兄弟姐妹中比自己年幼的人。","pronunciation":["동생"]},{"id":"34336435fffc8789","term":"더위","zh":"热，暑热","audio":"/audio/34336435fffc87890da8.mp3","entryId":"47399","definition":"夏季的暑气；炎热的天气。","pronunciation":["더위"]},{"id":"26dfca7d15ecbdb7","term":"약하다","zh":"弱","audio":"/audio/26dfca7d15ecbdb7d4a8.mp3","entryId":"71619","definition":"忍耐的力量不强。","pronunciation":["야카다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5cc207feba27d629be89.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71619-4-15-2","ko":"응, 걔는 여름에 에어컨 앞을 떠나서는 못 살더라.","zh":"对，他夏天不待在空调旁边就没法活。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"걔는","meaning":"“그 아이(那个孩子)”的缩略语。","explanation":"걔：“그 아이(那个孩子)”的缩略语。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"걔","audio":"/audio/6488cd1503b8fc1cb5fa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64369","senseId":"1","lemma":"걔","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걔는","audio":"/audio/4f80e605ecec1a908349.mp3"}},{"text":"여름에","meaning":"夏，夏天，夏季","explanation":"여름：夏，夏天，夏季；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"여름","audio":"/audio/4442e49ca3d7c1ba77c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67701","senseId":"1","lemma":"여름","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여름에","audio":"/audio/4d8be9bc13ecd85fb424.mp3"}},{"text":"에어컨","meaning":"空调","explanation":"에어컨：空调","readings":[{"term":"에어컨","audio":"/audio/4641fbad3b128eddb044.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62514","senseId":"1","lemma":"에어컨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"에어컨","audio":"/audio/4641fbad3b128eddb044.mp3"}},{"text":"앞을","meaning":"前面","explanation":"앞：前面；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"7","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앞을","audio":"/audio/d6a8b51597bdbc8049a2.mp3"}},{"text":"떠나서는","meaning":"撇开，脱离，离开","explanation":"떠나다：撇开，脱离，离开；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"떠나다","audio":"/audio/9ee56e8783da00e3fbed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"53746","senseId":"3","lemma":"떠나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"떠나서는","audio":"/audio/6b33da020d2cc960dd4e.mp3"}},{"text":"못","meaning":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","explanation":"못：不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}},{"text":"살더라.","meaning":"生活，过活，过日子","explanation":"살다：生活，过活，过日子；더라：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"살다","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69579","senseId":"2","lemma":"살다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"살더라","audio":"/audio/727cd260fdf81ad8319c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"6488cd1503b8fc1c","term":"걔","zh":"“그 아이(那个孩子)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/6488cd1503b8fc1cb5fa.mp3","entryId":"64369","definition":"“그 아이(那个孩子)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"4442e49ca3d7c1ba","term":"여름","zh":"夏，夏天，夏季","audio":"/audio/4442e49ca3d7c1ba77c7.mp3","entryId":"67701","definition":"四季之一，介于春秋之间的季节。","pronunciation":["여름"]},{"id":"4641fbad3b128edd","term":"에어컨","zh":"空调","audio":"/audio/4641fbad3b128eddb044.mp3","entryId":"62514","definition":"可以吹出凉快的空气、调节湿度的装置。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"ec1a6b96ce688b70","term":"앞","zh":"前面","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3","entryId":"88648","definition":"指某种环境或所处的状态。","pronunciation":["압"]},{"id":"9ee56e8783da00e3","term":"떠나다","zh":"撇开，脱离，离开","audio":"/audio/9ee56e8783da00e3fbed.mp3","entryId":"53746","definition":"断绝与某事或某人的关系，处于互不相干的状态。","pronunciation":["떠나다"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"12dad67abf287f9a","term":"살다","zh":"生活，过活，过日子","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3","entryId":"69579","definition":"人过生活。","pronunciation":["살ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2cf1e22d5279e190fd56.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.388,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=71619","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"4","sourceLevel":"초급","day":43,"sequenceScore":1.9015,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你弟弟好像特别怕冷啊？","你弟弟好像特别能耐热啊？","你弟弟好像很怕热啊？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["对，他夏天不待在空调旁边就没法活。","他夏天最不喜欢待在空调旁边。","他夏天即使没有空调也过得很好。"],"answer":0}]}
